meta {
	name: 06_RequestAndApprove
	seq: 6
}

docs {
	Scenario: A public sector system user requests a package and the organisation approves it

		Given the recipient has no pending request from the system user
		And the system user does not hold the package from the recipient
		When the system user requests the package from the recipient by organisation number
		And the recipient approves the request
		Then the request is approved
		And the system user sees the request as approved among its sent requests
		And the system user holds the package from the recipient
		Finally the package is removed from the system user to clean up
}
